# API Rules

Base path: /api/v1
JSON REST APIs.
Use validation and consistent errors:
timestamp, status, code, message, path, requestId.
Never expose secrets, credentials or internal stack traces.
Use pagination for collection endpoints.
Document APIs in OpenAPI.
